86	        if (!MessageDigest.isEqual(secret.getBytes(StandardCharsets.US_ASCII), JnlpAgentReceiver.DATABASE.getSecretOf(agent).getBytes(StandardCharsets.US_ASCII))) {
87	            LOGGER.warning(() -> "incorrect secret for " + agent);
88	            throw HttpResponses.forbidden();
89	        }
90	        JnlpConnectionState state = new JnlpConnectionState(null, ExtensionList.lookup(JnlpAgentReceiver.class));
91	        state.setRemoteEndpointDescription(req.getRemoteAddr());
92	        state.fireBeforeProperties();
93	        LOGGER.fine(() -> "connecting " + agent);
94	        Map<String, String> properties = new HashMap<>();
95	        properties.put(JnlpConnectionState.CLIENT_NAME_KEY, agent);
96	        properties.put(JnlpConnectionState.SECRET_KEY, secret);
97	        String unsafeCookie = req.getHeader(Engine.WEBSOCKET_COOKIE_HEADER);
98	        String cookie;
99	        if (unsafeCookie != null) {
100	            // This will blow up if the client sent us a malformed cookie.
101	            cookie = Util.toHexString(Util.fromHexString(unsafeCookie));
102	        } else {
103	            cookie = JnlpAgentReceiver.generateCookie();
104	        }
105	        properties.put(JnlpConnectionState.COOKIE_KEY, cookie);
106	        state.fireAfterProperties(Collections.unmodifiableMap(properties));
107	        Capability remoteCapability = Capability.fromASCII(remoteCapabilityStr);
108	        LOGGER.fine(() -> "received " + remoteCapability);
109	        rsp.setHeader(Capability.KEY, new Capability().toASCII());
110	        rsp.setHeader(Engine.REMOTING_MINIMUM_VERSION_HEADER, RemotingVersionInfo.getMinimumSupportedVersion().toString());
111	        rsp.setHeader(Engine.WEBSOCKET_COOKIE_HEADER, cookie);
112	        return WebSockets.upgrade(new Session(state, agent, remoteCapability));
113	    }
114	
115	    private static class Session extends WebSocketSession {
116	
117	        private final JnlpConnectionState state;
118	        private final String agent;
119	        private final Capability remoteCapability;
120	        private Transport transport;
121	
122	        Session(JnlpConnectionState state, String agent, Capability remoteCapability) {
123	            this.state = state;
124	            this.agent = agent;
125	            this.remoteCapability = remoteCapability;
126	        }
127	
128	        @SuppressFBWarnings(value = "RV_RETURN_VALUE_IGNORED_BAD_PRACTICE", justification = "method signature does not permit plumbing through the return value")
129	        @Override
130	        protected void opened() {
131	            Computer.threadPoolForRemoting.submit(() -> {
132	                LOGGER.fine(() -> "setting up channel for " + agent);
133	                state.fireBeforeChannel(new ChannelBuilder(agent, Computer.threadPoolForRemoting));
134	                transport = new Transport();
135	                try {
136	                    state.fireAfterChannel(state.getChannelBuilder().build(transport));
137	                    LOGGER.fine(() -> "set up channel for " + agent);
138	                } catch (IOException x) {
139	                    LOGGER.log(Level.WARNING, "failed to set up channel for " + agent, x);
140	                }
141	            });
142	        }
143	
144	        @Override
145	        protected void binary(byte[] payload, int offset, int len) {
146	            LOGGER.finest(() -> "reading block of length " + len + " from " + agent);
147	            try {
148	                transport.receive(ByteBuffer.wrap(payload, offset, len));
149	            } catch (IOException | InterruptedException e) {
150	                error(e);
151	            }
152	        }
153	
154	        @Override
155	        protected void closed(int statusCode, String reason) {
156	            LOGGER.finest(() -> "closed " + statusCode + " " + reason);
157	            IOException x = new ClosedChannelException();
158	            transport.terminate(x);
159	            state.fireChannelClosed(x);
160	            state.fireAfterDisconnect();
161	        }
162	
163	        @Override
164	        protected void error(Throwable cause) {
165	            LOGGER.log(Level.WARNING, null, cause);
166	        }
167	
168	        class Transport extends AbstractByteBufferCommandTransport {
169	
170	            Transport() {
171	                super(true);
172	            }
173	
174	            @Override
175	            protected void write(ByteBuffer headerAndData) throws IOException {
176	                // As in Engine.runWebSocket:
177	                LOGGER.finest(() -> "sending message of length " + (headerAndData.remaining() - ChunkHeader.SIZE));
178	                try {
179	                    sendBinary(headerAndData).get(5, TimeUnit.MINUTES);
180	                } catch (Exception x) {
181	                    throw new IOException(x);
182	                }
183	            }
184	
185	            @Override
186	            public Capability getRemoteCapability() throws IOException {
187	                return remoteCapability;
188	            }
189	
190	            @Override
191	            public void closeWrite() throws IOException {
192	                LOGGER.finest(() -> "closeWrite");
193	                close();
194	            }
195	
196	            @Override
197	            public void closeRead() throws IOException {
198	                LOGGER.finest(() -> "closeRead");
199	                close();
200	            }
201	        }
202	
203	    }
204	
205	}

